# CODEOWNERS for open-tax
#
# GitHub requests a review from the owners of a path when a pull request
# changes it. Country packs should gain an owner only after that person is
# listed in MAINTAINERS.md.
#
# Add one uncommented line per adopted pack:
#
# /packs/id/    @github-handle
# /packs/sg/    @github-handle
#
# A pack without an owner is still reviewed by the project maintainers
# named below, once this line is uncommented and the handle exists:
#
# *             @glc-works/open-tax-maintainers

# Schema and the reference library affect every pack. Leave these owned by
# the project maintainers when the GitHub team exists:
#
# /schemas/                 @glc-works/open-tax-maintainers
# /packages/open-tax/       @glc-works/open-tax-maintainers
